msgid "plugins.generic.earlyView.name"
msgstr "Early View"

msgid "plugins.generic.earlyView.description"
msgstr "A public page for accepted papers before their issue appears: title, authors and affiliations, both abstracts, keywords, acceptance date, the accepted manuscript PDF and an \"in press\" citation. The editor chooses what to show and which file; a paper leaves the list automatically when published and its link redirects to the final article. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

